        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage F62PLY, Oval Plymouth Double Cylinder Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPrimarily used on front doors, this Schlage made handleset features oval mounts on the outside. The Plymouth Handleset is a fine example of sophistication; but do not be fooled into thinking that functionality and quality have been sacrificed in the name of beauty. When you have a Schlage handleset on your front door, you know your home is secure. This handleset features ANSI Grade 1 security and has solid brass construction. A double cylinder handleset, the deadbolt is key operated from both the exterior and the interior while a thumbpiece operates the latch underneath the deadbolt from the exterior and a turnknob operates it from the interior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Double Cylinder Handleset:</b> The deadbolt is thrown or retracted by a key from the  both the outside and the inside. The latch is retracted by a thumbpiece from the outside and by a turn knob on the inside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching: <br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/plymouth-single-cylinder-handleset-schlage-f60ply\"><b>Plymouth Single Cylinder Handleset</b></a><br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/plymouth-dummy-cylinder-handleset-schlage-f93ply\"><b>Plymouth Dummy Handleset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Schlage Plymouth Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ANSI A156.5 Grade 1 security.</li>\r\n<li>Easy installation.</li>\r\n<li>All metal chassis for strength and durability.</li>\r\n<li>3 screw door frame reinforcer.</li>\r\n<li>Guaranteed to fit all standard door preparations.</li>\r\n<li>C keyway comes packaged with 2 keys.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Double Cylinder Plymouth Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Outside Handle Length: 12-13/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Handle Projection: 2-9/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Top Handle Plate Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Top Handle Plate Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Bottom Handle Plate Length: 2-9/10\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Bottom Handle Plate Width: 1-4/5\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Deadbolt Length: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Deadbolt Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Deadbolt Plate Length: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Deadbolt Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: will fit 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>5-1/2\" center to center deadbolt to latch spacing</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable throughbolt can move up and down 1-1/2\" to fit a variety of pre-existing holes</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: will fit 1-5/8\" up to 1-3/4\" packaged with extra screws to accommodate 2\" doors</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The inside trim will match the outside handleset's finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Plymouth Double Cylinder Handleset, Schlage F62PLY",
                "description": "Schlage F62PLY Plymouth Double Cylinder Handleset - Primarily used on front doors, this Schlage made handleset features oval mounts on the outside. The Plymouth Handleset is a fine example of sophistication; but do not be fooled into thinking that functionality and quality have been sacrificed in the name of beauty. When you have a Schlage handleset on your front door, you know your home is secure. This handleset features ANSI Grade 1 security and has solid brass construction. A double cylinder handleset, the deadbolt is key operated from both the exterior and the interior while a thumbpiece operates the latch underneath the deadbolt from the exterior and a turnknob operates it from the interior.",
